    "title": "Out of the Box hosting talk with artist tonight",
    "text": "Artist Murray Norcross will discuss his exhibition, “The Art of a Curious Mind,” from 5-7:30 p.m. Thursday, April 16, at the Out of the Box Studio & Gallery, 11 Clinton Ave.\nThe exhibition, defined by Norcross as “curious minds cultivating creative environments for themselves and their communities,” features his paintings, sculptures and an installation using bike chains.\nClients of the studio with developmental disabilities assisted Norcross in the exhibition, which closes Friday, April 24.",
